    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Kindness bends trajectories.”</em></p><p>You can interpose raw, forged radiance between violence and its target.</p><ul><li>When a creature within <strong>6 squares</strong> of you takes damage, you can use your <strong>reaction</strong> to flare your forge-light in a defensive pattern.</li><li>Reduce the damage taken by that creature by <strong>2d8 + your tier</strong>.</li><li>The attacker must make a <strong>Soul check</strong> (DC = your Resolve DC). On a failure, the next attack they make before the end of their next turn is made rolling 3d10 and keeping the lowest 2.</li><li>Any damage prevented in this way becomes <strong>temporary Integrity</strong> that you may distribute among allies of your choice within 2 squares of the protected creature.</li></ul><p><strong>Domain Echo..</strong> If your intercession prevents at least 10 total damage, your Domain gains <strong>+10 Soft Power marks</strong> for the next turn (once per scenario).</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
